# Local-only build tooling (NOT part of the public Knot repo)
# CrewAI wiring + demo data + CrewAI-specific fixes. Kept local; the
# llama-server endpoint/key live in two_agent_crew.py and must not be public.
two_agent_crew.py
requirements.txt
data/
fixes/fix_crewai_*

# ask_architect.py also carries the llama-server endpoint + bearer token.
ask_architect.py
# phase_crew.py likewise carries the LAN endpoint/key and is the local
# CrewAI runner for the agent crew. LOCAL-ONLY.
phase_crew.py
# architect_phase.py lets R1 draft/manage phase specs; carries the LAN key.
architect_phase.py
# autobuild.py is the autonomous phase driver (draft->tasks->crew->gate->push);
# carries the LAN key and imports the local-only tools above. LOCAL-ONLY.
autobuild.py
# crew_chats_viewer.py is the tkinter GUI that shows all crew members' chats.
# LOCAL-ONLY GUI tooling.
crew_chats_viewer.py
# chats/ holds per-task, per-role crew chat transcripts captured at runtime.
# Local run artifacts; not part of the public repo.
chats/

# Keep: source, docs, web, Knot fixes, progress, instructions
